{"organizations": [], "uuid": "2c0ef8a92a62ce0c127cce4ed57187d5b94b20a3", "thread": {"social": {"gplus": {"shares": 0}, "pinterest": {"shares": 0}, "vk": {"shares": 0}, "linkedin": {"shares": 0}, "facebook": {"likes": 0, "shares": 0, "comments": 0}, "stumbledupon": {"shares": 0}}, "site_full": "finance.sina.com.cn", "main_image": "http://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/109/w550h359/20180609/GaEa-hcscwxa9194848.jpg", "site_section": "http://roll.news.sina.com.cn/interface/rollnews_ch_out_interface.php?col=89&spec=&type=&ch=01&k=&offset_page=0&offset_num=0&num=60&asc=&page=7", "section_title": "", "url": "http://finance.sina.com.cn/stock/usstock/c/2018-06-09/doc-ihcscwxa9198896.shtml", "country": "CN", "domain_rank": 14, "title": "苹果要求供应商下半年减少iPhone配件生产--日经新闻|苹果_新浪财经_新浪网", "performance_score": 0, "site": "sina.com.cn", "participants_count": 1, "title_full": "", "spam_score": 0.0, "site_type": "news", "published": "2018-06-09T06:10:00.000+03:00", "replies_count": 0, "uuid": "2c0ef8a92a62ce0c127cce4ed57187d5b94b20a3"}, "author": "", "url": "http://finance.sina.com.cn/stock/usstock/c/2018-06-09/doc-ihcscwxa9198896.shtml", "ord_in_thread": 0, "title": "苹果要求供应商下半年减少iPhone配件生产--日经新闻|苹果_新浪财经_新浪网", "locations": [], "entities": {"persons": [], "locations": [], "organizations": []}, "highlightText": "", "language": "chinese", "persons": [], "text": "路透6月8日 - 日本经济新闻周五报导称， 苹果 （AAPL.O）已要求其配件供应商将2018年下半年iPhone配件产量减少约20%，这一报导带动 苹果 股价跌2%。\n日本经济新闻援引两位行业消息人士称，苹果预计今年iPhone出货量将为8，000万部，低于上年同期苹果预计的1亿部。\n“对于今年即将上市的iPhone手机，苹果下新订单时非常保守，”一位消息人士对日经称。\n苹果股价在周五美股盘前交易中下跌2.2%，至189.20美元；苹果供应商AMS （AMS.S）大跌6%，Dialog Semi （DLGS.DE）重挫4.1%。苹果通常在每年下半年推出新iPhone。\n报导称，苹果将在2018年推出三款新iPhone手机，料将在9月开始出货。\n对于置评要求，苹果没有立即回复。（完）\n文章来源于路透中文网\n责任编辑：张顺意\n文章关键词： 苹果 配件 苹果股价 我要反馈", "external_links": [], "published": "2018-06-09T06:10:00.000+03:00", "crawled": "2018-06-09T18:05:35.000+03:00", "highlightTitle": ""}